    "prompt": {
      "description": "A ragged militia footman in mismatched scavenged gear, stocky and small-limbed with an oversized head. A battered metal skullcap sits low over one side of the head; the other side is bare scalp and an open face. One shoulder carries a bulky salvaged pauldron and armoured sleeve; the opposite arm is thin, bare and wrapped in bandages. The chest is half patched cloth jerkin, half a single scavenged breastplate. One leg is booted, the other bare and wrapped. Held low and angled away from the body, an improvised wooden club with an iron-bound head. Nothing matches.",
